                                "sense_id": "d19e8cd7-e0d1-3ae9-bee3-1378f3aac901",
                                "text": "Perhaps nice isn't the best word for him, but he certainly was an unusually imposing and fluffy-haired and fierce-looking brute of a tarantula. He had rather an owly way about him, as if he had come out from his hole too early and was dazed and half-blinded by the light."
